            "paragraph": "It includes a tropospheric chemistry scheme from the United Kingdom Chemistry and Aerosols (UKCA) model22, which can be coupled with the dynamic wetland emissions scheme.",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
            "evidence_validated": true,
            "valid": true,
            "eval": true
        },
        {
            "source_entity_instance": "UKCA",
            "source_entity_type": "SourceComponent",
            "relation": "HAS_SOURCE_COMPONENT",
            "target_entity_instance": "TropIsop",
            "target_entity_type": "SourceComponent",
            "paragraph": "Here HadGEM2-ES is coupled to the TropIsop configuration of UKCA22, which includes isoprene chemistry missing in the standard CMIP5 version of HadGEM2-ES19,58.",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
            "evidence_validated": true,
            "valid": true,
            "eval": true
        },
        {
            "source_entity_instance": "HadGEM2-ES",
            "source_entity_type": "Source",
            "relation": "USES_PHYSICAL_SCHEME",
            "target_entity_instance": "lumped Mainz Isoprene Mechanism",
            "target_entity_type": "PhysicalScheme",
            "paragraph": "TropIsop employs the lumped Mainz Isoprene Mechanism22,59, but is otherwise identical to that implemented in HadGEM2-ES for CMIP5 (ref. 58).",
            "ontology_conformed": false,
            "evidence_validated": true,
            "valid": false,
            "eval": true
        },
        {
            "source_entity_instance": "HadGEM2-ES",
