            "paragraph": "When the chemistry model is employed atmospheric CH4 is either allowed to evolve freely (emissions-driven), or is prescribed at the surface (concentration-driven) with values of 675 and 375 p.p.b.v. for the pre-industrial and LGM, respectively.",
            "ontology_conformed": true,
